ind":"announcement","title":"The Dead Hand demo is now available on Steam!","summary":"The Dead Hand demo is now available on Steam! Dead Hand will also be part of Steam Next Fest from October 19 to 26. Try the demo, tell me what you think, and add the game to your wishlist if you enjoy it! Thanks for your support 🧟 — Hauteroche Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T23:03:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067927750","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631120-1844751498235465","game_id":"steam-4631120","kind":"announcement","title":"Alpha v0.9.20 : contrats revus, manette complète et 10 langues","summary":"What's newFairer contracts: \"The Great Escape\" no longer breaks on the first HP you lose. You now get an HP budget for the whole act (60 % / 40 % / 25 % depending on difficulty), tracked on the map. Controller reviewed on every screen: soft-locks fixed, everything is reachable, buttons are consistent (B always goes back) and there are on-screen prompts. Ten languages in beta: German, Spanish (Spain and Latin America), Brazilian Portuguese, Polish, Russian, Ukrainian, Turkish, and Simplified and ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-29T21:04:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498235465","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631120-1840310314347555","game_id":"steam-4631120","kind":"announcement","title":"The Playtest opens its doors","summary":"The Playtest opens its doorsAfter months of closed alpha with a small core of testers, Dead Hand is entering Public Playtest. Starting today, anyone can put in for a spot.It works like this: head to the Dead Hand Steam page and hit \"Request Access\". Requests are then reviewed and access is handed out in waves, build by build — the goal being to keep the tester group small enough that I can actually read and act on every piece of feedback.If you don't make the first wave, your request stays in th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T14:35:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631120-1838407329267411","game_id":"steam-4631120","kind":"announcement","title":"Dead Hand Trailer Alpha V0.9.1","summary":"🩸 The First Dead Hand Trailer Is Here — Alpha V0.9.1Survivors, the wait is over. We're finally pulling back the curtain on Dead Hand with our very first trailer.Step into a post-apocalyptic world where every card can seal your fate. In this roguelike deckbuilder wrapped in gritty '90s comic-book art, you take on the role of survivors who'll do whatever it takes to claw through hostile biomes — from abandoned metros to ruined military bases. Build your deck, manage your provisions, and face down ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T19:44:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329267411","verified_at":"2026-10-20T15:34:26Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4631120-1832700592787471","game_id":"steam-4631120","kind":"announcement","title":"The first 6 survivors have arrived!","summary":"The wasteland is no longer empty. Dead Hand's first six playable characters are now in the game, each with their own deck archetype, signature mechanics, and story scars from the world before.From hardened scavengers to broken believers, every survivor brings a distinct playstyle to the run — new synergies 